{"4789230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hanabi Craft", "steam_appid": 4789230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HanabiCraft is a 3D fireworks crafting simulation where you create your own fireworks, launch them into the night sky, and enjoy the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your fireworks by placing colored stars and materials inside a fireworks shell. Carefully crafted shells will bloom into unique patterns and colors when launched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the process of creating fireworks and discover what kind of masterpiece will appear in the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fireworks Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own fireworks by arranging colored stars inside the shell. Simple tools allow easy creation, while detailed controls let you design more complex patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Launch and Watch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your handcrafted fireworks in beautiful environments and see how your design comes to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Fireworks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fireworks inspired by real-world structures and appearances, recreated in 3D.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New fireworks types, features, and improvements will be added in future updates.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HanabiCraft is a 3D fireworks crafting simulation where you create your own fireworks, launch them into the night sky, and enjoy the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your fireworks by placing colored stars and materials inside a fireworks shell. Carefully crafted shells will bloom into unique patterns and colors when launched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the process of creating fireworks and discover what kind of masterpiece will appear in the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fireworks Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own fireworks by arranging colored stars inside the shell. Simple tools allow easy creation, while detailed controls let you design more complex patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Launch and Watch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your handcrafted fireworks in beautiful environments and see how your design comes to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic Fireworks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy fireworks inspired by real-world structures and appearances, recreated in 3D.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New fireworks types, features, and improvements will be added in future updates.</p>", "short_description": "Create your own fireworks, craft shells, and watch your designs light up the night sky.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789230/de1af3979da0575ff177a0ad08be18b7f41fd596/header.jpg?t=1787476103", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789230/0ede04157816b36e4d9b0b245ee09b4d09469dfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787476103", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4789230/0ede04157816b36e4d9b0b245ee09b4d09469dfd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787476103", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</str